  - id: historian_rew
    text: Oh yeah! Of course. My excitement was in the way of some recognition for
      you. Here is some money. The towns shipmaster will create bigger sails for
      you. When you use that holy shell you have, the sails should catch more wind
      (That shell belongs in a museum!).
